msgstr "Brugeravatar"

msgid ""
"This e-mail address is already in use. Please supply a different e-mail "
"address."
msgstr "Denne e-mailadresse er allerede i brug. Angiv venligst en anden."

msgid "This username is already taken. Please pick something else."
msgstr "Dette brugernavn er allerede taget. Vælg venligst et andet."

