"All previously configured authentication apps will be discarded upon "
"verification of the new app."
msgstr ""
"Alle tidligere konfigurerede godkendelsesapps slettes ved verifikation af "
"den nye app."

msgid ""
"Other two-factor methods (such as WebAuthn and security keys) won't be "
"affected."
msgstr "Andre tofaktormetoder (såsom WebAuthn og loginnøgler) påvirkes ikke."

msgid "The entered token is not valid."
msgstr "Den indtastede token er ugyldigt."

msgid "Recovery token"
msgstr "Gendannelsestoken"

